  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-498\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"77\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a subset of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"78\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> if every element of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"79\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is an element of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"80\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>With that in mind, let's inspect the given choices.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"81\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2124 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <em>not</em> a subset of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"82\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211A TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.297em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> For example, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"83\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2124 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> but <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"84\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2209\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"4\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211A TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.297em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∉</mo><msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"85\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2124 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is  a subset of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"86\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211A TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.297em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Every positive integer is a positive rational number.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"87\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2115 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> a subset of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"88\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211A TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.297em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Every natural number is a positive rational number.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\".</p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">III only</div></div>",
